# JARVIS Project Memory

## Project Overview
- **Path:** `C:\Users\toshi\Documents\main jarvis`
- **Backend:** Python FastAPI (`backend/`) + Uvicorn
- **Client:** Flutter Windows desktop (`client/`)
- **Flutter path:** `C:\flutter\bin\flutter.bat` (run with `-d windows`)
- **GitHub:** `https://github.com/Qrow00/Hey-Olivia.git`

## Architecture
- Single WebSocket connection (`/ws`) for all real-time communication
- REST endpoints for device/camera/wearable CRUD
- State management: manual `StreamController.broadcast()` + `setState()` (no Provider/Bloc)
- Services exported as module-level singletons
- Playwright sync API on dedicated worker thread (not async) — Windows ProactorEventLoop limitation
- All `_call()` to browser worker must use `asyncio.to_thread`

## GPU & Inference
- **GPU:** AMD Radeon RX 6600 (8GB VRAM)
- **Local LLM:** Ollama with `llama3.2:latest` (2.0 GB)
- **STT:** Whisper `tiny` model (auto-detects CUDA via `torch.cuda.is_available()`)
- **TTS:** Edge TTS (`en-US-GuyNeural` default)
- **Cloud LLM:** Nemotron Ultra 550B via NVIDIA NIM API (planned)

